# Shared .dockerignore for all 4 worker images — the build context is ./workers.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/logs.log
# Rust build artifacts must never leak into the Python images (the nesting
# Dockerfile rebuilds the engine in its own Rust builder stage).
nesting/engine/target
# Test fixtures / debug helpers are not needed at runtime but are small and
# harmless; keep them so images stay debuggable.
